# Generated Bloom triad containment rules for login UID @LOGIN_UID@.
# The Signer has no IP authority. Broker may only emit packets belonging to
# its canonical loopback HTTP listener. ACK-bearing replies from that fixed
# source port are allowed; Broker-initiated SYNs, every other Broker flow, and
# every Signer flow are denied. The disposable W0 lane must prove reply and
# deny behavior.
pass out quick on lo0 inet proto tcp \
  from 127.0.0.1 port 18734 to 127.0.0.1 \
  flags A/A user @BLOOM_BROKER_UID@
pass out quick on lo0 inet6 proto tcp \
  from ::1 port 18734 to ::1 \
  flags A/A user @BLOOM_BROKER_UID@
block return out quick proto { tcp, udp } all user @BLOOM_SIGNER_UID@
block return out quick proto { tcp, udp } all user @BLOOM_BROKER_UID@
